  "body": "# v0.16.1: clearer source errors and Drive freshness reporting\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Missing or malformed source responses now report a lookup failure instead of an empty notebook. Studio preserves source lookup errors, including timeouts. Notes remain separate from sources.\n- Drive freshness checks distinguish unknown status from confirmed stale sources, and sync reports skipped sources.\n\nThe source diagnostics were prompted by #397. We have not confirmed that this release resolves the reporter’s underlying issue.\n\n### Credits\n\nThanks to @insane66613 for #396 and @akperkins for reporting #397.\n",
